peakerId":10048,"speakerName":"デットエージェント","textMapHash":2789762918,"text":"フン、只者ではないな…このままでは予想外の損失になる。","nextNodeIds":[120030802]},{"nodeId":120030802,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":162601,"speakerName":"茂才公","textMapHash":2347887494,"text":"もっと痛めつけてやってください！そして、石珀を！","nextNodeIds":[120030803]},{"nodeId":120030803,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10048,"speakerName":"デットエージェント","textMapHash":4171925038,"text":"「ファデュイ」とお前は、ビジネス上の協力関係なだけだ。お前の尻拭いまでしてやるつもりはない。","nextNodeIds":[120030804]},{"nodeId":120030804,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":162601,"speakerName":"茂才公","textMapHash":1567395046,"text":"な、なにを？こ、これもそちらの注文のためではありませんか！","nextNodeIds":[120030805]},{"nodeId":120030805,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10048,"speakerName":"デットエージェント","textMapHash":45649022,"text":"注文の件は、自分でなんとかしろ。","nextNodeIds":[120030806]},{"nodeId":120030806,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":162601,"speakerName":"茂才公","textMapHash":746496318,"text":"い、行かないでください！お、おい、待て！","nextNodeIds":[120030807]},{"nodeId":120030807,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1627,"speakerName":"阿旭","textMapHash":2757578518,"text":"坊っちゃま！どうしてここに？怪我はありませんか？","nextNodeIds":[120030808]},{"nodeId":120030808,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":2255320742,"text":"#ああ、{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_XIABOY|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_XIAGIRL]}のおかげで無事だ。","nextNodeIds":[120030809]},{"nodeId":120030809,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":493745942,"text":"坊っちゃま！？","nextNodeIds":[120030810,120030811]},{"nodeId":120030810,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2807673038,"text":"坊っちゃま！？","nextNodeIds":[120030812]},{"nodeId":120030812,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":162601,"speakerName":"茂才公","textMapHash":2803261694,"text":"お、お前が「飛雲商会」の御曹司？","nextNodeIds":[120030813]},{"nodeId":120030813,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":4118904006,"text":"ああ、僕が古華派門弟、そして「飛雲商会」会長の次男──行秋だ。","nextNodeIds":[120030814]},{"nodeId":120030814,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":162601,"speakerName":"茂才公","textMapHash":1814553726,"text":"クソッ、ハメられた…","nextNodeIds":[120030815]},{"nodeId":120030815,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":2912791758,"text":"茂才公、強要による売買は商人としてどうかと思うよ。ここは商人らしいやり方で解決しよう。","nextNodeIds":[120030816]},{"nodeId":120030816,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":643682598,"text":"この石珀がなければ、「ファデュイ」が君をどうするか、想像してあげようか？","nextNodeIds":[120030817]},{"nodeId":120030817,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":162601,"speakerName":"茂才公","textMapHash":388681326,"text":"チッ…言え、どうすればその石珀を譲ってくれるんだ！","nextNodeIds":[120030818]},{"nodeId":120030818,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":2002218742,"text":"常九殿には七割引の値段と言っていたな。ではこうしよう。","nextNodeIds":[120030819]},{"nodeId":120030819,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":2952425950,"text":"通常価格の三倍、これでどうかな？","nextNodeIds":[120030820]},{"nodeId":120030820,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":162601,"speakerName":"茂才公","textMapHash":3946128662,"text":"ッ！足元を見やがって！き、貴様…いい加減にしろ！","nextNodeIds":[120030821]},{"nodeId":120030821,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":2801705102,"text":"まあ、そう叫ぶな。買うの、それとも買わないの？","nextNodeIds":[120030822]},{"nodeId":120030822,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":162601,"speakerName":"茂才公","textMapHash":492841678,"text":"…はぁ、分かった、三倍で売ってくれ、それでいいんだな！","nextNodeIds":[120030823]},{"nodeId":120030823,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":1149829198,"text":"毎度あり、今後とも何卒よろしく頼むよ。","nextNodeIds":[120030824]},{"nodeId":120030824,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3304926062,"text":"お、おまえ、「飛雲商会」の御曹司だったのか！？","nextNodeIds":[120030825]},{"nodeId":120030825,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3341725382,"text":"じゃあ、オイラたちが使ってたモラは全部おまえの財布から——","nextNodeIds":[120030826]},{"nodeId":120030826,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":2056118806,"text":"気にするな。損することのない商売な上に、茂才公にお仕置きできた。一石二鳥だ。","nextNodeIds":[120030827,120030829]},{"nodeId":120030827,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2226604046,"text":"人は見かけによらない。","nextNodeIds":[120030828]},{"nodeId":120030828,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":3140107182,"text":"ハハッ、そう褒めるなよ。君の正義もなかなか感心したぞ。","nextNodeIds":[120030831]},{"nodeId":120030831,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1332948310,"text":"あーーッ！オイラ、コイツのことずっと本の虫って呼んでた！","nextNodeIds":[120030832]},{"nodeId":120030832,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":612429878,"text":"お坊ちゃまを怒らせたら、相手の手足を斬るって武侠小説で読んだことあるぞ！","nextNodeIds":[120030833]},{"nodeId":120030833,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":604649654,"text":"どうしよう？どうすればいい？ごめん！本当にオイラが悪かった！許してくれっ！","nextNodeIds":[120030834]},{"nodeId":120030834,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":2869760070,"text":"君は飛べるんだし、足がなくても平気だろう。","nextNodeIds":[120030835]},{"nodeId":120030835,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1088024718,"text":"#うわっ！その目は本気だ！{NICKNAME}、助けろ！","nextNodeIds":[120030836,120030837]},{"nodeId":120030836,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":334919822,"text":"からかってるだけだよ…","nextNodeIds":[120030838]},{"nodeId":120030838,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":4103731310,"text":"くくっ、冗談はここまでにして、今回のことは助かった、本当にありがとう。","nextNodeIds":[120030839]},{"nodeId":120030839,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":93628782,"text":"この『神霄折戟録』もなかなか面白かった。これを常九殿に返してきてくれないか。","nextNodeIds":[120030840]},{"nodeId":120030840,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2348087558,"text":"また使い走り？","nextNodeIds":[120030841]},{"nodeId":120030841,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":1750501318,"text":"だって、僕は何もしていないのに、お礼を言われるのもなんだろう。君たちは関係ないのに、最後まで協力してくれたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[120030842]},{"nodeId":120030842,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":1812970150,"text":"これほど義侠の心のある人と知り合えただけで、僕は満足だからね。","nextNodeIds":[120030843]},{"nodeId":120030843,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1627,"speakerName":"阿旭","textMapHash":2906574990,"text":"坊ちゃま、お話の途中で申し訳ありませんが、旦那様の方には…","nextNodeIds":[120030844]},{"nodeId":120030844,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":3042767606,"text":"ああ、父上には今回の件を解決したついでに、大金を稼いだと伝えてくれ。","nextNodeIds":[120030845]},{"nodeId":120030845,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":3913029558,"text":"だから、このことに免じてあと数日だけ時間をくれないか？『神霄折戟録』の中に秘境の話があってね、そこに行ってみたいんだ…","nextNodeIds":[120030846]},{"nodeId":120030846,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1306804270,"text":"そんなこと言って、本当は本を返しに行くのが面倒なだけだろ！","nextNodeIds":[120030847]},{"nodeId":120030847,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":2303957294,"text":"ハハッ、常九殿ならきっと謝礼も準備してくれていると思うよ？","nextNodeIds":[120030848]},{"nodeId":120030848,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2705791742,"text":"謝礼！…ま、まあ、行ってやらなくもないか…","nextNodeIds":[120030849]},{"nodeId":120030849,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1627,"speakerName":"阿旭","textMapHash":2840570910,"text":"はぁ、何を言っても坊ちゃまは止められませんね…","nextNodeIds":[120030850]},{"nodeId":120030850,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3567532310,"text":"何で行秋の正体を教えてくれなかった？","nextNodeIds":[120030851]},{"nodeId":120030851,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1627,"speakerName":"阿旭","textMapHash":255821310,"text":"し、知らないとは思わなかったです…","nextNodeIds":[120030852]},{"nodeId":120030852,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":1840150406,"text":"では、本を返すことは頼んだ。縁があったらまた会おう。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":120030837,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":871417022,"text":"読んだのは本当に武侠小説なの？","nextNodeIds":[120030838]},{"nodeId":120030829,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2280032318,"text":"御曹司は字の練習をしないの？","nextNodeIds":[120030830]},{"nodeId":120030830,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":1397824286,"text":"ハハハッ、それは大目に見てくれ。僕の字を見れば僕だってすぐ分かるから、ある意味便利なんだ。","nextNodeIds":[120030831]},{"nodeId":120030811,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1983993678,"text":"…やはりそうなんだ。","nextNodeIds":[120030812]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1200308,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["12"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REMOVE_TRIAL_AVATAR"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["10045","30"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":1200309,"order":8,"stepDescription":"『神霄折戟録』を返却する","stepDescTextMapHash":1265883736,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1200309,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN