0030903,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1618411814,"text":"力になれてよかった。","nextNodeIds":[120030905]},{"nodeId":120030905,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"常九","textMapHash":1282659366,"text":"ああ、そう言わずに、このことはわしにとって本当に大きなことなんだから。","nextNodeIds":[120030906]},{"nodeId":120030906,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"常九","textMapHash":1095740846,"text":"常家は璃月では大きい一族だったが、わしが若くして当主を継いだ時、商売で何度も失敗して家の財産を失ってしまったんだ…","nextNodeIds":[120030907]},{"nodeId":120030907,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"常九","textMapHash":1811831398,"text":"一族の栄光を取り戻そうと、ここ数年は必死に頑張ってきた…今回の石珀の商いは、わしの全財産をかけた希望だったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[120030908]},{"nodeId":120030908,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"常九","textMapHash":4209757278,"text":"君たちがいなかったら、おそらくわしは無事でいられなかっただろう。","nextNodeIds":[120030909]},{"nodeId":120030909,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2506709430,"text":"おまえも「お坊ちゃま」だったんだな…","nextNodeIds":[120030910]},{"nodeId":120030910,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"常九","textMapHash":753352862,"text":"ん？どういう意味だ？","nextNodeIds":[120030911]},{"nodeId":120030911,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4095211718,"text":"なんでもないぞ！そうだ、本を返しに来たんだ！","nextNodeIds":[120030912]},{"nodeId":120030912,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"常九","textMapHash":3918600206,"text":"ああ、『神霄折戟録』！あの古華派の少年、急に姿をくらませたから泥棒かと思ってたところだ！","nextNodeIds":[120030913]},{"nodeId":120030913,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1168600894,"text":"古華派…そんなにまずいところなのか？","nextNodeIds":[120030914]},{"nodeId":120030914,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"常九","textMapHash":3485861230,"text":"門派自体は数百年の歴史があって輝かしい時期もあったが、今ではもう落ちぶれたな。","nextNodeIds":[120030915]},{"nodeId":120030915,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"常九","textMapHash":619518782,"text":"門派の復興には新たな血が必要になるだろう…しかし、ずっと衰え落ちぶれたままでは新しい人材も入ってこないはずさ。","nextNodeIds":[120030916]},{"nodeId":120030916,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"常九","textMapHash":2940233878,"text":"今の古華派の若者ときたら…たとえばあの少年、恩返しとか言ってたくせに、君たちの半分の仕事もしてないじゃないか。","nextNodeIds":[120030917,120030918]},{"nodeId":120030917,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1336182998,"text":"それは違うかも。","nextNodeIds":[120030919]},{"nodeId":120030919,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"常九","textMapHash":4215096278,"text":"はぁ、まあこの話はどうでもいい。そうだ、『テイワット観光ガイド』の璃月編が欲しかったんだろ！用意しておいたぞ。","nextNodeIds":[120030920]},{"nodeId":120030920,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"常九","textMapHash":1039210622,"text":"これは君たちにあげよう。それから、ほんの気持ち程度だが謝礼も…","nextNodeIds":[120030921,120030922]},{"nodeId":120030921,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3876815078,"text":"ありがとう、頑張った甲斐があった。","nextNodeIds":[120030923]},{"nodeId":120030923,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"常九","textMapHash":3938085670,"text":"鉱石も売れて、我が愛書たちも戻ってきた、本当に…","nextNodeIds":[120030924]},{"nodeId":120030924,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"常九","textMapHash":4107040270,"text":"うん？","nextNodeIds":[120030925]},{"nodeId":120030925,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":189075790,"text":"どうした？なんか落ちたぞ。","nextNodeIds":[120030926]},{"nodeId":120030926,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"常九","textMapHash":1832129862,"text":"いや、なんでもない…","nextNodeIds":[120030927]},{"nodeId":120030927,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"常九","textMapHash":3752708334,"text":"（あの少年…まさか…）","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":120030922,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3882320550,"text":"忘れるところだった。","nextNodeIds":[120030923]},{"nodeId":120030918,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3015029446,"text":"古華派の転機はもうすぐ来るかも。","nextNodeIds":[120030919]},{"nodeId":120030904,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3133316838,"text":"大したことはしていない。","nextNodeIds":[120030905]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1200309,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["100364","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_DEL_PACK_ITEM"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133106145,1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1624"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[{"talkId":1200306,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","beginCond":[{"param":["1200306","2"],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}